From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:02:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: resume the active HLS rendition across queue restarts

Keep only the source-provided fallback height in the existing queue entry.
Resolve fresh URLs on continue, preserve the selected segment cache, allow one
retry when a source list's compressed response ends early, and account for
the two in-flight segments when comparing repeat failures. Keep the existing
one-alternate limit and all validation of completed files.

---
